{"text":"In the electoral process itself, there is significant improvement from the days when violent overthrows were the default means of transition. A clear recent example stands out in West Africa. Although they did not get as much focus as post-election violence in Cote d'Ivoire, Niger and Guinea proved exemplary when the military oversaw democratic elections, turned power over to the civilian government, and returned to the barracks. In the case of Cote d'Ivoire, the economic community of West African states and the African Union recognized a non-incumbent as the legitimate winner.","words":[{"text":"In","start":5.04,"end":5.8},{"text":"the","start":5.8,"end":6.56},{"text":"electoral","start":6.56,"end":7.0},{"text":"process","start":7.0,"end":7.62},{"text":"itself","start":7.62,"end":8.08,"punct":","},{"text":"there","start":8.3,"end":8.36},{"text":"is","start":8.36,"end":8.5},{"text":"significant","start":8.5,"end":8.92},{"text":"improvement","start":8.92,"end":9.64},{"text":"from","start":9.64,"end":10.0},{"text":"the","start":10.0,"end":10.16},{"text":"days","start":10.16,"end":10.42},{"text":"when","start":10.42,"end":10.76},{"text":"violent","start":10.76,"end":11.16},{"text":"overthrows","start":11.16,"end":12.02},{"text":"were","start":12.02,"end":12.68},{"text":"the","start":12.68,"end":12.8},{"text":"default","start":12.8,"end":13.24},{"text":"means","start":13.24,"end":13.7},{"text":"of","start":13.7,"end":13.92},{"text":"transition","start":13.92,"end":14.54,"punct":"."},{"text":"A","start":15.9,"end":15.94},{"text":"clear","start":15.94,"end":16.3},{"text":"recent","start":16.3,"end":16.74},{"text":"example","start":16.74,"end":17.44},{"text":"stands","start":17.44,"end":17.9},{"text":"out","start":17.9,"end":18.24},{"text":"in","start":18.24,"end":18.4},{"text":"West","start":18.4,"end":18.6},{"text":"Africa","start":18.6,"end":19.12,"punct":"."},{"text":"Although","start":20.64,"end":21.14},{"text":"they","start":21.14,"end":21.48},{"text":"did",